{"id":"presa","lemma":"presa","pos":"noun","rank":2543,"glosses":["reservoir, dam","piece of meat","portion or piece of food"],"ipa":"/ˈpɾesa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"presas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-presa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vivo cerca de la presa.","en":"I live near the dam.","words":[{"g":"alive, living"},null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"close to"]]},{"text":"Los halcones son aves de presa.","en":"Falcons are birds of prey.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639235","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"falcon","l":"halcón"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"bird","l":"ave"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Aquí solía haber una villa antes de que construyeran la presa.","en":"There used to be a village here before the dam was made.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"small town"},{"g":"earlier"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[6,8,"that"]]},{"text":"Los castores construyen presas.","en":"Beavers build dams.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"beaver","l":"castor"},{"g":"to build","l":"construir"},null]}]}